# M24.4 item 2 -- WFI-idle-after-exit test. Loads the FRESH ticker.exe built with
# BSP_RESET_BOARD_AT_EXIT=0 (third_party/renode/M24_4/rtems-bsp-noreset/, isolated rebuild,
# not the shared toolchain output) against AltaVista's own platform file (item 1's fix, TTC
# frequency corrected -- both fixes must be in effect together since item 1's gate blocks
# everything downstream). No RunFor/quit here; the driving Python script owns stepping.

:name: av-m24-4-wfi-idle-test

using sysbus
using sysbus.cluster0
using sysbus.cluster1

mach create "av-m24-4-wfi-idle-test"

machine LoadPlatformDescription @/Users/probe/code/AltaVista/third_party/renode/platforms/cpus/zynqmp.repl

uart0 CreateFileBackend $ORIGIN/wfi_idle_uart.log true

macro reset
"""
    cluster0 ForEach IsHalted true
    cluster1 ForEach IsHalted true
    rpu0 IsHalted false

    sysbus LoadELF @/Users/probe/code/AltaVista/third_party/renode/M24_4/rtems-bsp-noreset/myout/rtems-build/arm/zynqmp_rpu_lock_step/testsuites/samples/ticker.exe cpu=rpu0
"""

runMacro $reset
